      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-111912",
      ":question/problem": "The marginal CDFs of two continuous independent random variables $X$ and $Y$ are given below.\n\n$F_{X}(x) = {1 - e^{-2x},\\begin{vmatrix}x \\ge 0 \\\\ 0,\\end{vmatrix}otherwiseF_{Y}(y) = {1 - e^{-3y},\\begin{vmatrix}y \\ge 0 \\\\ 0,\\end{vmatrix}otherwise$\n\nFind the expression for the joint CDF when $x \\ge 0$ and $y \\ge 0$."
